meta {
  name: Reports Muster (combined attendance)
  type: http
  seq: 41
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/hr/attendance/reports/muster?month=2026-09&branch=all&format=json
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  month: 2026-09
  branch: all
  format: json
  ~org_id: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

docs {
  Combined attendance (muster) sheet: one row per employee (profile, department,
  DOJ, branch), one P / HD / HD/L / A / L / LOP / WO / H cell per day, and
  Total Present Day / Weekoff Paid / Paid Leave / Holidays / Total Paid Days.
  format=xlsx adds a blank Final Paid Days column for HR.

  Needs hr.reports.attendance.view. branch=current = the session branch
  (.org scope). branch=all = every branch of the tenant and needs
  hr.reports.attendance.view.tenant; enable org_id to narrow it to one branch.
  Expect 403 for branch=all without the tenant scope, and for an org_id
  outside the tenant.
}
